  "scale": {
    "hpMultPerRound": 1.18,
    "extraNotes": "Rounds 46+ are procedural: the engine reuses rounds 38-44 as templates in rotation, multiplying every enemy hp by 1.18^(n-45) (round, minimum +1 per step), bounty stays at the base value so income flattens while threat compounds. Every 3rd procedural round appends 1 extra colossus, every 5th appends a random miniboss at full template hp scale. Spawn windows stay 20-30s. Send unlocks are all open past round 45. With these multipliers a maxed economy defense collapses near round 58-62, which forces a winner by attrition. Speeds and child chains never scale, only hp."
  }
